@startuml
actor "用户" as User

boundary "聊天界面" as ChatUI
boundary "PDF 预览界面" as PdfViewerUI
boundary "剪贴板界面" as ClipboardUI

control "RAG 控制器" as RagController
control "OCR 控制器" as OcrController

entity "PDF 实体" as PdfEntity
entity "向量库实体" as VectorStoreEntity
entity "嵌入模型实体" as EmbeddingEntity
entity "LLM 实体" as LLMEntity
entity "OCR 模型实体" as OcrModelEntity
entity "LaTeX 处理实体" as LatexEntity

== 离线RAG问答 ==
User -> ChatUI : 输入问题(question)
ChatUI -> RagController : 提问(question, pdfId)

RagController -> PdfEntity : 加载 PDF(pdfId)

alt 向量索引不存在
  RagController -> PdfEntity : 切分为文本块()
  RagController -> EmbeddingEntity : 生成向量(chunks)
  RagController -> VectorStoreEntity : 存储向量(vectors)
end

RagController -> EmbeddingEntity : 生成问题向量(question)
RagController -> VectorStoreEntity : 检索 TopK(queryVector)
RagController -> LLMEntity : 生成回答(promptWithContext)
LLMEntity --> RagController : 流式返回答案(tokens)
RagController -> ChatUI : 流式输出到界面(tokens)
RagController -> ChatUI : 展示来源(chunks)

== OCR公式提取 ==
User -> PdfViewerUI : 框选公式区域(rect)
PdfViewerUI -> OcrController : 识别公式(pdfId, rect)

OcrController -> PdfEntity : 提取图像(rect)
OcrController -> OcrModelEntity : 推理识别(image)
OcrModelEntity --> OcrController : latexText

OcrController -> LatexEntity : 规范化(latexText)
OcrController -> PdfViewerUI : 显示 LaTeX(latex)

User -> PdfViewerUI : 点击复制
PdfViewerUI -> ClipboardUI : 复制(latex)

@enduml